set.body:
Implement a reusable FoldPipeline that performs fold-local preprocessing, operator-policy fitting, program construction, lowering, solver execution, evidence validation, fit-bundle construction, scoring, and transformation.

Acceptance:
- every learned chart, graph, shrinkage policy, alignment, and hyperparameter is fitted only on training rows;
- requested and lowered programs, effective operators, auxiliary variables, solver settings, attestations, and lifecycle events remain inspectable;
- cached fits or candidates reused across folds are rejected;
- at least one exact quadratic model and one nonsmooth constrained model tune end to end;
- feature and row identity are preserved through final transformation;
- JVM and Scala.js lifecycle and leakage suites pass.
